# Docker reads .dockerignore from the root of the *build context*, which for
# this image is apps/web — the repository-root .dockerignore does not apply.
#
# Patterns are NOT .gitignore syntax: a trailing slash does not mean "this
# directory at any depth". Use **/ explicitly.
#
# node_modules matters most — host-installed packages are the wrong
# architecture for the image and are hundreds of MB of pointless build context.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.pnpm-store
**/.env
**/.env.local
